{"Title":"An Act to rehabilitate regional roadways","BillNumber":"H3390","DocketNumber":"HD3126","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"NJO1","Name":"Norman J. Orrall","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NJO1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:49:14.387"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"NJO1","Name":"Norman J. Orrall","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NJO1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:49:14.3866667"},{"Id":"DFD1","Name":"David F. DeCoste","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DFD1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-05T16:54:13.2566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3390/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Orrall of Lakeville, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3390) of Norman J. Orrall for legislation to rehabilitate certain regional roadways.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 50 of chapter 6C of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 8, the word “and”.\r\n\tSECTION 2.  Section 50 of chapter 6C of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting after the word \"commonwealth\", in the in line 10, the following words:- \r\n\t“, and (5) rehabilitation and improvement of corridors on which regional economic activity generates significant truck traffic.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}